flowchart TD
    WEB["https://streamcart.com/product/123 (App Link, verified)"] --> OS["OS routes to app (no chooser, Digital Asset Links)"]
    SCHEME["streamcart://order/456 (internal/notification)"] --> OS
    NOTIF["notification tap PendingIntent (Ch 49/50)"] --> OS
    OS --> ROUTER["DeepLinkRouter: Uri -> typed destination"]
    ROUTER --> VALIDATE{validate params - untrusted, Ch 23}
    VALIDATE -->|invalid| SAFEFAIL["fail safe: home / error, no crash"]
    VALIDATE -->|valid| ACCOUNT{account matches? Ch 42}
    ACCOUNT -->|no| SWITCH["switch/confirm account"]
    ACCOUNT -->|yes| AUTH{auth required and logged in?}
    AUTH -->|logged out| LOGIN["route to login -> resume to target (Ch 21)"]
    AUTH -->|ok| NAV["Navigation: destination + synthesized back stack (Ch 53)"]
    NAV --> SERVERAUTHZ["fetch over authed API -> server authorizes (IDOR-safe, Ch 23/19)"]
